<div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Die Danaiden</hi>.</hi></head><lb/>
<p>Der funfzig To&#x0364;chter des <hi rendition="#fr">Danaus,</hi> Ko&#x0364;nigs<lb/>
